%% The title page is described in a separate style file
%% (not integrated into sebook.sty) because numbering for the title page is normally not
%% printed (i, ii), and can therefore be printed separately from the report.
%% Also the title page style changes often.

%% DAvB
%% V1.0a added: \coaching, \reportline, \dateline
%%       changed: \frontpage
